Keep a shared xpowers as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared ypowers as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared totals as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared power as 0.
Keep a shared base as 0.
Keep a shared bound as 0.
To growx.
If power is more than bound, return.
Place power into xpowers.
If base is 1, return.
Set power to power times base.
Growx.

To growy.
If power is more than bound, return.
Place power into ypowers.
If base is 1, return.
Set power to power times base.
Growy.

Set power to 1.
Set base to 2.
Set bound to 10.
Growx.
Set power to 1.
Set base to 3.
Growy.
For each left in xpowers.
For each right in ypowers.
The sum is left plus right.
If sum is at most 10, Place sum into totals.

Sort totals.
The previous is 0.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of totals.
If spot is 0, show item spot of totals.
If spot is more than 0 and item spot of totals is not previous, show item spot of totals.
Set previous to item spot of totals.
